","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-20T13:44:30Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T13:44:30Z","body":"(I made a quick PR to disable WebXR if `proxy_to_pthread` is enabled: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118780 :slightly_smiling_face:)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4281281305/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4288116712","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118777#issuecomment-4288116712","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118777","id":4288116712,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_l3fo","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T11:20:06Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T11:29:22Z","body":"I did a little bit of research on the changes here:\r\n\r\n- `-sTEXTDECODER=1` is now the default, which (according to [the docs](https://emscripten.org/docs/tools_reference/settings_reference.html#textdecoder)), means that TextDecoder will be used _if available_, with a fallback if not available. Of course, we'll need to see how this works in practice, but this sounds like what we want (and looking at the original issue, it seems like there used to be bugs in the fallback). So, I think removing the option (what this PR is doing) makes sense\r\n- `_emscripten_proxy_main` does still exist [in the source code](https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/6913738ec5371a88c4af5a80db0ab42bad3de681/system/lib/libc/crt1_proxy_main.c#L38) for Emscripten 4.0.20. However, if Godot still works (~~I haven't personally tested it yet~~) when using `proxy_to_pthread` even with this removed, then I guess it's probably fine? Adding it to `EXPORTED_RUNTIME_METHODS` symbols would imply that we want to call it manually from JavaScript, but I don't see that anywhere","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4288116712/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4288206173","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118777#issuecomment-4288206173","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118777","id":4288206173,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7_mNVd","user":{"login":"NoctemCat","id":22471296,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDcxMjk2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22471296?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat","html_url":"https://github.com/NoctemCat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NoctemCat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-21T11:36:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-21T11:36:03Z","body":"I also found the comment about the older `_proxy_main` https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/14312#issuecomment-849726435\r\n> I think proxy_main has always been an internal detail - you should not need to export it, or call it, or even be aware of it. Just setting PROXY_TO_PTHREAD will do everything for you automatically.\r\n> \r\n> For examples, you can look in tests/*, which has many tests for PROXY_TO_PTHREAD, and it never mentions proxy_main.\r\n\r\nSo this could be why it is linking without it successfully.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4288206173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4304861726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118777#issuecomment-4304861726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118777","id":4304861726,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAJb6Hg","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-23T13:41:00Z","updated_at":"2026-04-23T13:41:00Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4304861726/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]